.TH SPP-make-app 1 "27 June 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
spp-make-app \- Create a new SPP application context
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php make:app
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new SPP application context
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --mode=
Expects a value. Extracted via static analysis from MakeAppCommand.php
.TP
.B --ai-blueprint=
Expects a value. Extracted via static analysis from MakeAppCommand.php
.TP
.B --enterprise
Boolean flag. Extracted via static analysis from MakeAppCommand.php
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Static analysis reveals the following runtime behaviors:
.PP
\(bu Interacts with the SPP database layer directly.
.br
\(bu Performs raw filesystem modifications (create/write/delete).
.br
\(bu Executes external system binaries or shell commands.
.br
\(bu Dynamically loads kernel modules: name, parikshak, sppqueue.
.br
\(bu Instantiates key components: SPP, \PDO, state, methods, Date.
.br
